      "amount": "1/4 cup"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Slice the kabanos sausages into 1/2 inch thick rounds.",
    "Place the sausage rounds on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper and bake for 10 minutes.",
    "Meanwhile, mix the olive oil, lemon juice, garlic, sumac, salt, and black pepper in a small bowl.",
    "Brush the mixture onto the sausage rounds and continue baking for another 5 minutes.",
    " Warm the ssam wrap leaves by wrapping them in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20 seconds.",
    "Spread a tablespoon of tahini onto each ssam wrap leaf.",
    "Place a few sausage rounds onto each leaf, then top with pomegranate seeds.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
  ],
